This is an unofficial Minecraft 26.3 Fabric port maintained by YearEnd1.
The port includes API and world-generation migrations, compatibility fixes,
Simplified Chinese localization, dynamic biome names, and optional Waystones
generation integration. It is not an official release of the upstream project.

Original authorship, Git history, source notices, and acknowledgements are retained.
See README.upstream.md for the upstream acknowledgements, including ivory rosewood's music.
